If you're dealing with API (as it may seem), I best suggest to re-construct the structure of your JSON into something like this:
{
  "items": [{
    "id":"11",
    "user_id":"8000",
    "product":"Shoes A",
    "quantity":"1",
    "date_open":"2015-01-04",
    "paid":"1",
