You can do that  with alignat*, which inserts no space between alignment columns, combined with eqparbox, which defines  box commands like the standard ones, with a difference: they use a system of tags in the place of a width argument, and all boxes sharing the same tag have as width the natural width of the widest contents. Note this may require two compilations to adjust the widths.
