S_n &=\eqmathbox[1]{(a_1)} &&+\eqmathbox[2]{(a_2)} & & + \eqmathbox[3]{(a_3)} & & + \dots + (\eqmathbox[n-1]{a_1}+[n-1]d)\\
S_n &=\eqmathbox[1]{(a_n)}& &+ \eqmathbox[2]{(a_{n-1})} & & +\eqmathbox[3]{(a_{n-2})} & & + \dots + (\eqmathbox[n-1]{a_n}+[n-1]d)
